<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/34/msa@/~cl_12> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "12" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/34/msa@> .
